text='''# Batch107 independent review

Exact source commit: 447d7976d5a94aa59c0c2d36ef7985e035ef440f

- dendrocystites r001: PASS for static independent review.
- trochocystites r001: REVISE. Central pavement is coarser/larger than the marginal frame, reversing the frozen small-pavement distinction. Both groove ends visibly cross the oral opening.
- helicoplacus r001: REVISE. The ambulacral strip visibly bridges the lateral oral opening and shell plating intrudes behind it. Only the local junction/recess needs cleanup.
- stromatocystites r001: PASS for static independent review, including fresh aboral verification.

Technical and runtime-parse checks pass for all four exact subjects. Visual, factual and specification fail for the two repair subjects. GPU and composed scene are UNKNOWN for all four. This is not publication approval.

## Verified

322-file submission identity and additional manifest/freeze/dependency bindings were checked against exact committed bytes; 996 contextual path/hash bindings resolve. Original coordination claim/inventory/requirements and all frozen inputs remain unchanged. All four genuine concept originals match the committed pixels. All32 final512px frames,4 lossless sheets and4 details were personally inspected. Original fossil/cast pixels and relevant primary text were independently inspected. Five new exact-GLB supplementary images cover T/H mouth junctions and S underside.

Each original source was reopened and exported with exact recorded options; all four reexports are byte-identical to final GLBs. Original indexed source topology and exact-position original GLB winding pass without welding/recalculation. All physical plates contact their hosts; each semantic feature has global exposure across26 diagnostic directions. Project checks, Khronos0errors/0warnings and actual Three.js parsing pass. Two retained separate Blender-process semantic rebuilds per asset were verified against their request/result/execution/output bytes and final semantics.

## Smallest repair

T: Refine only the pavement into visibly smaller irregular units, and connect unequal grooves to the mouth perimeter without bridging through its opening. No exact replacement plate count is prescribed.

H: Trim/reroute the path termini around the mouth and clear interfering local shell surfaces, while preserving actual base contact. Retain three paths, left-handed shell and current body/endpoint anatomy.

Preserve accepted D/S source identities and the original freeze. New affected revisions need fresh exact-bound validation/rebuild/render evidence and targeted independent difference review. No uploads, PRs, merges, counters or release actions were taken.

Detailed evidence, source qualifications and stage separation are in independent-qa.report.json. Numeric ray-sampling artifacts are not independent failure gates; repair decisions are confirmed in exact-subject pixels.
'''
(O/'INDEPENDENT-QA.md').write_text(text)
